rfectly and the breading stayed on bite after bite. The restaurant is owned by 5 beautiful sisters and they were so sweet to my family. Really great people, food, and energy in this place! Would definitely come back!"},{"business_id":"sbp-DjxxPbWmCHuQvwzbNA","review_id":"ch1dRRyFCg7k-CjPEyvGRg","date":"2020-03-16T18:45:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9165546894073486,"text_excerpt":"What an amazing find! All of the best restaurants we found in town were outside of the tourist hotspots and this one topped the list. Newly opened, this restaurant offers amazing service with a great mix of innovative and familiar offerings. We were greeted by one of the owners and sat at the bar. The bartender made some of the freshest and most interesting (not sweet or syrupy) drinks we had on our trip! The food was well-prepared with good portion sizes. We wish we could have eaten more. We were only in town a couple of days but flirted with the idea of returning for dinner a second night...which we should have done. Will definitely return here on our next visit."},{"business_id":"sbp-DjxxPbWmCHuQvwzbNA","review_id":"mI55xqKqkacgDbersbWBfQ","date":"2020-03-07T00:17:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9026899337768555,"text_excerpt":"We were so please to see another place to join our neighbourhood. We found it to be all anyone who loves family, fresh food, nice environment, great service, and reasonable prices, etc could ask for. Thanks ladies for making this a new kitchen for us to enjoy. Tim n Skip"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"sbp-DjxxPbWmCHuQvwzbNA","photo_id":"Zw1lGQu7xPzGP039qW8J5Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Zw1lGQu7xPzGP039qW8J5Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9999999403953552}]},"notebook_case":null}
